ing 30-day period at the end of a month could include requests from the 1st to the 30th. The following day would take requests made from the 2nd to the 31st."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6c","term":"marquee","definition":"A big, spotlighted event that is meant to draw attention and generate excitement."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6d","term":"Quad 1","definition":"Home games vs. RPI teams ranked in the top 30; neutral games vs. 1-50; away games vs. 1-75."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6e","term":"Quad 2","definition":"Home vs. 31-75 teams; neutral vs. 51-100; away vs. 76-135."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f6f","term":"Quad 3","definition":"Home vs. 76-160 teams; neutral vs. 101-200; away vs. 136-240."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f70","term":"Quad 4","definition":"Home vs. 161-plus teams; neutral vs. 201-plus; away vs. 241-plus."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f71","term":"RESTful","definition":"An architectural style for an application programming interface (API) that uses HTTP requests to access and use data."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f72","term":"General Sport API","definition":"The General Sport APIs provide a breadth of coverage across numerous leagues worldwide. All General Sport APIs follow a consistent structure and format between sports, making it easy to consume the data across different leagues or competitions."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f73","term":"GraphQL","definition":"Click [here](https://graphql.org/learn/) to learn more about GraphQL!"},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f74","term":"Rolling Quota","definition":"Our rolling 30-day schedule means calls from 31 days prior are removed from your quota each day.\n\nFor example, a rolling 30-day period at the end of a month could include requests from the 1st to the 30th. The following day would take requests made from the 2nd to the 31st."},{"_id":"692497cca2be85c6ca237f75","term":"GUID","definition":"Global Unique Identifier"}],"graphqlSchema":"","gracePeriod":{"enabled":false,"endsAt":null}